> i want to get it to work right. Thanks.

   My guess is that you are sufficiently young to think (as most Windozes
do) that "fullscreen DOS" is 50 rows of text, not the canonical 25 rows.
Try

     mode con:lines=25

before running Nethack.  Or else do as I do, and change the properties
of the "Command Prompt" application to run

     cmd.exe /K mode con: lines=25

instead of just plain 'cmd.exe'.  If you ever want to switch back to
icky-text mode, 'mode con:lines=50' will get you there.

   (And FWIW, this has nothing to do with VGA, as far as I know.  I
think even CGA monitors can do 50-line text mode.)

